{"seq":2,"slug":"supplier-onboarding-capability-model","title":"供应商准入与能力档案建模（SKU 覆盖、时效、区域、盲发资质）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/dropship-model-supplier-network/supplier-onboarding-capability-model","wordCount":3185,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"供应商准入与能力档案建模-sku-覆盖-时效-区域-盲发资质\">供应商准入与能力档案建模（SKU 覆盖、时效、区域、盲发资质）</h1><p>一家做家居品类的跨境卖家在旺季前把 SKU 从 800 扩到 4000、供应商从 3 家加到 17 家，结果第 11 天开始订单大量卡在「已付款未发货」。复盘发现：问题不是供应商不发货，而是<strong>没有一个地方记录过「这家供应商能不能发这个国家、发不发光一个没有自己 logo 的包裹、平均几天出货」</strong>——采购谈的是价格与 SKU 数量，履约信息散落在微信、邮件和业务员的记忆里。本文要解决的，就是把「一家代发供应商能不能扛住某个订单」从人的印象变成机器可判定的结构化事实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-能力档案是可查询的准入判定向量-不是联系人表\">核心概念：能力档案是可查询的准入判定向量，不是联系人表</h2><p>代发（dropshipping）与普通批发采购的根本区别在于<strong>履约责任仍在卖家，执行动作在供应商</strong>。供应商每一次接单，都是卖家把「对客户的时效与体验承诺」外包了出去。能力档案（Supplier Capability Profile，SCP）的职责，就是让系统在<strong>下单前</strong>而不是<strong>客诉后</strong>回答四个问题：覆盖这个 SKU 吗？覆盖这个目的国吗？能在承诺时效内出货吗？能盲发吗？</p>\n<p>把它理解成「供应商主数据表里多几列」是绝大多数首次扩容踩坑的源头。档案至少在四个正交维度上给出可验证取值，任何一维缺失，对应订单就应在路由阶段被提前排除。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[供应商能力档案 SCP] --&gt; B[目录能力&lt;br/&gt;SKU/变体/GTIN 覆盖]&#10;  A --&gt; C[时效能力&lt;br/&gt;lead time/cut-off/产能]&#10;  A --&gt; D[区域能力&lt;br/&gt;发货地-目的国-渠道]&#10;  A --&gt; E[盲发资质&lt;br/&gt;白标/单据/包装]&#10;  B --&gt; F[路由准入判定]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{四维全绿?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[进入候选池]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[排除并记录缺失维度]\">graph TD\n  A[供应商能力档案 SCP] --&gt; B[目录能力&lt;br/&gt;SKU/变体/GTIN 覆盖]\n  A --&gt; C[时效能力&lt;br/&gt;lead time/cut-off/产能]\n  A --&gt; D[区域能力&lt;br/&gt;发货地-目的国-渠道]\n  A --&gt; E[盲发资质&lt;br/&gt;白标/单据/包装]\n  B --&gt; F[路由准入判定]\n  C --&gt; F\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{四维全绿?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[进入候选池]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[排除并记录缺失维度]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>典型失效表现</th>\n<th>可验证证据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目录能力</td>\n<td>能不能发这个 SKU</td>\n<td>下单后供应商说「这款断供」</td>\n<td>库存/目录 API 或对账文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效能力</td>\n<td>几天内出货、截单点几时</td>\n<td>承诺 3 天实际 9 天</td>\n<td>近 30 天出货时效分位数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域能力</td>\n<td>发货地到目的国是否可达</td>\n<td>发到巴西被卡清关</td>\n<td>渠道覆盖表 + 历史妥投率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>盲发资质</td>\n<td>包裹是否以我方名义</td>\n<td>客户收到带别家 logo 的盒子</td>\n<td>装箱单样本 + 包装规范确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这四维<strong>互相不可替代</strong>。一家 SKU 覆盖 99% 的供应商，如果只有深圳直发渠道，对需要「美国本土 3 日达」的订单就是零覆盖；一家能盲发的供应商，如果截单点是北京时间下午 3 点，对美西客户的「当日达」承诺同样无效。把四维拍平成一个「综合评分」再排序是常见错误——评分管排序，四维布尔判定管准入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"准入流水线-四道门-每道门有可核验的通过条件\">准入流水线：四道门，每道门有可核验的通过条件</h2><p>准入不是「通过审核就给权限」，而是一条有门禁的流水线，每道门的通过条件必须是<strong>可核验的证据</strong>而非「对方说可以」。成熟做法是四道门：资质核验 → 能力自报与实测 → 试单验证 → 分级授权。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>通过条件</th>\n<th>失败后的动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>G1 资质核验</td>\n<td>主体真实可追责</td>\n<td>执照/注册信息、对公账户、经营地址三处一致</td>\n<td>拒绝，不进入能力评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G2 能力自报</td>\n<td>建立初始档案</td>\n<td>提交 SKU 清单、覆盖国家、承诺时效、盲发声明</td>\n<td>标记为「自报未验证」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G3 实测验证</td>\n<td>用真实数据校准自报</td>\n<td>近 30 天出货分位数、妥投率、取消率在阈值内</td>\n<td>降级为「受限供应商」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G4 分级授权</td>\n<td>决定可承接的订单范围</td>\n<td>按四维评分分配可路由的品类/区域/订单量上限</td>\n<td>仅开放小批量试单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>G2 与 G3 之间是分水岭。供应商自报的「3 天出货」几乎总是乐观值——它指「仓库没事的时候」，不含缺货补货、周末、节假日、爆单排队。<strong>实测阶段不看平均值，看分位数</strong>：一家平均 3.2 天但 P95 是 14 天的供应商，比平均 4 天、P95 只有 6 天的供应商危险得多，因为尾部延迟才是客诉和平台绩效扣分的来源。G4 的分级授权则把供应链风险做成一个<strong>可撤回的、按流量比例放大的信任</strong>：新供应商即使四维全绿，也先限制订单量上限与品类范围，随实测累积再放开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时效能力建模-承诺时间来自分位数-不是承诺话术\">时效能力建模：承诺时间来自分位数，不是承诺话术</h2><p>把「供应商时效」存成一个字段是最常见的建模偷懒。可用的时效模型至少三个量：<strong>处理时长</strong>、<strong>截单点</strong>、<strong>运输时长</strong>，承诺给客户的到货时间由前两者加一个带安全边际的运输时长推出。设某供应商-目的国组合的历史出货处理时长为随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>promise</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>transit</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>buffer</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{promise}} = Q_{1-\\alpha}(L) + T_{\\text{transit}} + T_{\\text{buffer}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buffer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{1-\\alpha}(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是处理时长的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-\\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 分位数（取 P90 或 P95 而非均值），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>transit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{transit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是渠道公布的运输时长中位数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>buffer</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{buffer}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buffer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是清关、天气、旺季的缓冲。若处理时长近似正态分布，分位数可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{1-\\alpha} = \\mu_L + z_{1-\\alpha}\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——这也解释了为什么只存均值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不够：<strong>波动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大的供应商，需要吃掉更多缓冲才能守住同一承诺</strong>。截单点则决定「今天下的单算不算今天出货」，必须与目的国/时区绑定，并在路由判定里加入「当前时刻是否已过截单点」这一实时条件。产能（capacity_daily）同理：一家平常 P95=6 天的供应商，在大促爆单时可以瞬间退化成 P95=20 天，因为瓶颈从「处理速度」变成了「排队长度」——档案层要把容量上限与 processing 分位数一并暴露出去，逼近上限时路由才溢出到次优供应商。</p>\n<h2 id=\"区域能力建模-发货地到目的国是一张有方向的覆盖图\">区域能力建模：发货地到目的国是一张有方向的覆盖图</h2><p>代发供应商的「区域能力」不是「能发哪些国家」的国家列表，而是一张<strong>有方向的、带渠道的覆盖图</strong>：从哪个发货地（origin），经哪条渠道（channel），到达哪个目的国（destination），以及链路上的历史妥投率与清关表现。跨境代发里最常见的两类区域误判：第一类是<strong>把「能寄」当成「能做好」</strong>——国际小包理论上能寄到 200 多个国家和地区，但不同目的国的清关难度、末端派送质量、退货可行性天差地别，把「可达」等同于「可承诺」会带来大量妥投失败；第二类是<strong>忽略发货地与目的国的匹配约束</strong>——海外仓（美国仓、欧洲仓）直发本地能做到 2-5 日达，中国直发到欧美普遍需要 7-15 日，同一个 SKU 从哪个仓发，决定它能否进入「快速达」商品池。因此「区域能力」应存成一张带渠道维度的覆盖表，而非 <code>ships_to: [...]</code> 国家数组。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>覆盖单元</th>\n<th>origin</th>\n<th>destination</th>\n<th>channel 类型</th>\n<th>承诺时效</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本土快发</td>\n<td>美国仓</td>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>本土快递</td>\n<td>2-5 日</td>\n<td>高客单/时效敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域直发</td>\n<td>欧洲仓</td>\n<td>欧盟内</td>\n<td>区域包裹</td>\n<td>3-7 日</td>\n<td>欧盟合规订单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境直发</td>\n<td>中国仓</td>\n<td>北美</td>\n<td>国际专线</td>\n<td>7-15 日</td>\n<td>长尾/低价 SKU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境小包</td>\n<td>中国仓</td>\n<td>全球</td>\n<td>邮政小包</td>\n<td>15-40 日</td>\n<td>极长尾/低时效要求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>覆盖图应支持<strong>按 SKU 与目的国的联合查询</strong>：给定一个 SKU 和一个目的国，返回所有可覆盖的 (origin, channel) 组合及其承诺时效——这才是路由真正需要的接口。区域能力还必须与合规资格绑定：代发跨境订单会触及目的国进口合规（如欧盟 IOSS 增值税、美国各州销售税、部分品类准入认证），供应商是否具备合规履约资格属于「区域能力」的一部分——一个不能合规清关的渠道，等于这条覆盖边不存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"盲发资质建模-包裹以谁的名义到客户手里\">盲发资质建模：包裹以谁的名义到客户手里</h2><p>盲发（blind shipping）是代发的默认要求：客户收到的包裹、装箱单、发票上都不应出现供应商的品牌、logo、联系方式，而应以卖家（或卖家指定的白标）名义呈现。它直接决定品牌一致性、复购归因，以及某些平台上「谁是被记录的发货方」的合规判定。盲发资质需拆成三个可独立核验的子能力：<strong>包装盲发</strong>（外箱与内衬不带供应商品牌，或可换用中性/白标包装）、<strong>单据盲发</strong>（装箱单、发票、退换货卡可定制为卖家名义且不泄露供应商信息）、<strong>物流盲发</strong>（面单上的发货人名称/地址可设为卖家或卖家海外仓）。</p>\n<p>第三项最容易被忽略却最致命：即使包装完美，如果面单上的发件人写的是供应商公司名，客户一查物流轨迹就能看到，盲发即告失败。因此盲发资质应存成三个布尔位加一个「单据模板可得性」证据字段，而不是笼统的 <code>blind_ship: true</code>。盲发还与税务交叉：供应商以卖家名义发货时，进口清关单据上的<strong>进口商/收件人主体</strong>归属影响税务判定，不同目的国对 IOSS 号、EORI 号、销售税登记要求不同；档案需区分「供应商代缴」与「卖家自缴」两种模式并记录供应商持有的对应凭证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"档案落地-单一事实源-字段版本与能力衰减\">档案落地：单一事实源、字段版本与能力衰减</h2><p>把上述四维落成可维护的系统，有三条工程原则决定成败。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，单一事实源（SSOT）。</strong> 供应商能力必须只有一个权威来源，路由、客服、采购、对账全部读它，任何一方都不能私存副本。大量事故来自「采购手里有份 Excel、系统里有份表、路由读的是缓存」，三份数据在供应商换仓或涨价时分叉。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，字段级版本与证据链。</strong> 每个能力字段应带 <code>value</code>、<code>source</code>（自报/实测/合同）、<code>verified_at</code>、<code>expires_at</code>。路由优先用实测数据，实测缺失时回退到自报并打低置信度标记，而非把两者混成一个数字。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，能力衰减。</strong> 供应商能力会随时间退化：时效随爆单变差、盲发资质随更换包装供应商而失效、区域覆盖随渠道停运而收窄。档案必须<strong>周期性重算</strong>而非一次录入永久有效——给每个维度设有效期，过期未复评的字段降级为「不可路由」。最终目标是让「这家供应商能不能接这个单」变成一个<strong>在订单创建前就能算出的布尔结果</strong>：四维档案齐全且实时，路由才有资格按成本、时效、风险在合格供应商之间选择；档案层不建模，路由层的一切优化都是在有缺陷的输入上做精致计算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>治理维度</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>不做的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一事实源</td>\n<td>路由/客服/采购共读一份</td>\n<td>多副本分叉，事故时对不上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段级证据</td>\n<td>value/source/verified_at 三件套</td>\n<td>自报与实测混用，判定失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期性重算</td>\n<td>每字段设有效期 + 过期降级</td>\n<td>陈旧能力仍在接单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺失即排除</td>\n<td>维度缺失则不可路由</td>\n<td>带着未知风险发货</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>供应商能力档案是<strong>四维准入判定向量</strong>（目录/时效/区域/盲发），四维布尔判定管准入，综合评分只管排序，两者不混用。</li>\n<li>准入是<strong>四道门</strong>流水线（资质→自报→实测→分级授权），每道门有可核验证据，新供应商先限量再放开。</li>\n<li>时效承诺来自<strong>分位数而非均值</strong>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>promise</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>transit</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>buffer</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{promise}} = Q_{1-\\alpha}(L) + T_{\\text{transit}} + T_{\\text{buffer}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buffer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；截单点与产能按时区/旺季动态建模。</li>\n<li>区域能力是<strong>有方向的 (origin, channel, destination) 覆盖图</strong>且与合规资格绑定；「可达」不等于「可承诺」。</li>\n<li>盲发资质拆成<strong>包装/单据/物流</strong>三个子能力，物流面单主体最易被忽略却最致命。</li>\n<li>档案要落地为<strong>单一事实源 + 字段级证据链 + 周期性重算</strong>，缺失维度即排除，让未知风险无法随订单流出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"供应商准入与能力档案建模（SKU 覆盖、时效、区域、盲发资质）","id":"供应商准入与能力档案建模-sku-覆盖-时效-区域-盲发资质"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：能力档案是可查询的准入判定向量，不是联系人表","id":"核心概念-能力档案是可查询的准入判定向量-不是联系人表"},{"level":2,"text":"准入流水线：四道门，每道门有可核验的通过条件","id":"准入流水线-四道门-每道门有可核验的通过条件"},{"level":2,"text":"时效能力建模：承诺时间来自分位数，不是承诺话术","id":"时效能力建模-承诺时间来自分位数-不是承诺话术"},{"level":2,"text":"区域能力建模：发货地到目的国是一张有方向的覆盖图","id":"区域能力建模-发货地到目的国是一张有方向的覆盖图"},{"level":2,"text":"盲发资质建模：包裹以谁的名义到客户手里","id":"盲发资质建模-包裹以谁的名义到客户手里"},{"level":2,"text":"档案落地：单一事实源、字段版本与能力衰减","id":"档案落地-单一事实源-字段版本与能力衰减"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代发履约模式与商业模型分类（纯代发/一件代发/仓配代发/白标）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/dropship-model-supplier-network/dropship-fulfillment-models-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"供应商寻源、分层与履约质量运营（后备供货、比价、淘汰机制）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/dropship-model-supplier-network/supplier-network-sourcing-tier-ops"}}